@@@ note
Every line of a wrapped quote carries the '> ' marker, and the quote wraps narrower to make
room for it.

@@@ input
> quoted text that is long enough that it needs to wrap across more than one line

@@@ wrap 80
> quoted text that is long enough that it needs to wrap across more than one
> line

@@@ wrap 30
> quoted text that is long
> enough that it needs to wrap
> across more than one line

@@@ unwrap
> quoted text that is long enough that it needs to wrap across more than one line
